@startuml
title Luong nghiep vu chinh: Khach hang dat xe, ghep tai xe va hoan thanh chuyen

autonumber "<b>0</b>"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #1F2937
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7280
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor "Khach hang\n(Customer App)" as C #DCEBFA
participant "API Gateway\n(REST, JWT, RBAC)" as GW #E9D5FF
participant "Auth Service" as AU #DBEAFE
participant "Booking Service" as BS #FECACA
participant "Driver Service" as DS #DCFCE7
participant "Tai xe\n(Driver App)" as D #FEF3C7
participant "Trip Service" as TS #EDE9FE
participant "Payment Service" as PS #FDE68A
queue "Kafka\n(Message Broker)" as K #F3E8FF
participant "Notification Service" as NS #EDE9FE

database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_auth)" as AUDB #FFFFFF
database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_booking)" as BDB #FFFFFF
database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_driver)" as DDB #FFFFFF
database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_trip)" as TDB #FFFFFF
database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_payment)" as PDB #FFFFFF
database "PostgreSQL\n(cab_notification)" as NDB #FFFFFF
collections "Redis\n(Geo, TTL, locks, rate limit)" as R #FEE2E2

note over C,D
Tien dieu kien:
- Khach hang da dang ky tai khoan CUSTOMER.
- Tai xe da duoc ADMIN duyet (ACTIVE) va dang AVAILABLE.
- Tai xe cap nhat vi tri khi bat trang thai san sang.
end note

== Dang nhap (thuc hien truoc khi dat xe) ==

C -> GW : POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{username, password}
activate GW
GW -> AU : gRPC Invoke(login)
activate AU
AU -> AUDB : Tim user theo username
AUDB --> AU : User + password_hash + role
AU -> AU : bcrypt.compare(password, password_hash)
AU --> GW : 200 {JWT, uid, role, expires_in}
deactivate AU
GW --> C : 200 {token}
deactivate GW

== Tao booking va tim tai xe ==

C -> GW : POST /api/v1/bookings\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT\n{pickup, dropoff, vehicle_type}
activate GW
GW -> GW : Kiem JWT HS256, issuer, expiry\nva role = CUSTOMER
GW -> R : Kiem tra token revoke + rate limit
R --> GW : Chua revoke; request duoc phep
GW -> BS : gRPC Invoke(create)\ncustomer_id lay tu JWT
activate BS

BS -> DS : gRPC Invoke(nearby)\nvi tri don, ban kinh 1 km
activate DS
DS -> R : GEOSEARCH drivers AVAILABLE\nsap xep theo khoang cach
R --> DS : Danh sach uid theo khoang cach
DS -> DDB : Kiem tra approval_status = ACTIVE\nva availability = AVAILABLE
DDB --> DS : Danh sach tai xe hop le
DS --> BS : Candidates gan nhat truoc
deactivate DS

alt Co tai xe phu hop
  BS -> BDB : INSERT Booking\nstatus = SEARCHING_DRIVER\nluu candidate_driver_uids va tai xe dau tien
  BDB --> BS : Booking da luu
  BS -> R : SET offer-exp:{booking_id}\nTTL = 15 giay, driver_uid
  R --> BS : Offer co hieu luc
  BS ->> K : cab.booking.events\nBookingCreated + DriverOfferCreated
else Khong co tai xe trong ban kinh 1 km
  BS -> BDB : INSERT Booking\nstatus = NO_DRIVERS_AVAILABLE
  BDB --> BS : Booking da luu
  BS ->> K : cab.booking.events\nBookingCreated (khong co offer)
end

GW <-- BS : 201 Created\nbooking_id, status, offered_driver_uid
deactivate BS
GW --> C : 201 Created\nThong tin booking ban dau
deactivate GW

== Xu ly offer va tai xe chap nhan ==

K ->> NS : Consume BookingCreated / DriverOfferCreated
activate NS
NS -> NDB : Ghi notification log\n(event_id duy nhat)
NDB --> NS : Da ghi log
deactivate NS

note over D,NS #F3E8FF
Backend tao offer va Kafka event, nhung Notification Service hien chi ghi log.
Push/SMS/realtime delivery den ung dung tai xe chua duoc cai dat.
Tai xe chap nhan offer hien tai qua API khi biet booking_id.
end note

opt Booking dang SEARCHING_DRIVER
  loop Tung tai xe theo thu tu gan nhat; toi khi chap nhan, huy hoac het candidates
    alt Tai xe chap nhan trong 15 giay
      D -> GW : POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/accept\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
      activate GW
      GW -> GW : Kiem JWT va role = DRIVER
      GW -> BS : gRPC Invoke(accept)\nbooking_id, driver_id tu JWT
      activate BS
      BS -> R : Lay Redis mutex booking + driver
      R --> BS : Da lock hoac lock dang bi giu
      alt Lock thanh cong; offer van thuoc tai xe nay
        BS -> BDB : SELECT booking FOR UPDATE\nkiem tra SEARCHING_DRIVER
        BDB --> BS : Booking va assigned offer
        BS -> R : Kiem offer-exp:{booking_id}\ncon han va driver_uid khop
        R --> BS : Offer hop le
        BS -> DS : gRPC Invoke(set_busy)
        activate DS
        DS -> DDB : AVAILABLE -> BUSY
        DDB --> DS : Tai xe da duoc giu cho chuyen
        DS -> R : Xoa tai xe khoi Redis Geo available
        DS --> BS : Cap nhat trang thai tai xe thanh cong
        deactivate DS
        BS -> R : Xoa offer TTL
        BS -> TS : gRPC Invoke(create_from_booking)\nbooking_id, customer_id, driver_id, fare
        activate TS
        TS -> TDB : INSERT Trip\nstatus = DRIVER_ASSIGNED
        TDB --> TS : Trip da tao
        TS --> BS : Trip details
        deactivate TS
        BS -> BDB : UPDATE Booking\nstatus = DRIVER_ASSIGNED\nassigned_driver_uid = driver_id
        BDB --> BS : Booking da gan tai xe
        BS ->> K : cab.trip.events\nDriverAssigned
        BS --> GW : 200 OK {booking_id, trip}
        deactivate BS
        GW --> D : 200 OK {trip}
        deactivate GW
        K ->> NS : Consume DriverAssigned
        activate NS
        NS -> NDB : Ghi event log
        NDB --> NS : Da ghi log
        deactivate NS
        break Da ghep thanh cong; tiep tuc thuc hien chuyen
      else Offer het han, sai tai xe hoac co tranh chap lock
        BS --> GW : 409 Conflict
        deactivate BS
        GW --> D : 409 Conflict
        deactivate GW
      end
    else Khach hang huy booking khi dang tim tai xe
      C -> GW : POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/cancel\n{reason}
      activate GW
      GW -> GW : Kiem JWT va role = CUSTOMER
      GW -> BS : gRPC Invoke(cancel)\ncustomer_id lay tu JWT
      activate BS
      BS -> BDB : UPDATE status = CANCELED\nchi khi dang SEARCHING_DRIVER
      BDB --> BS : Booking da huy
      BS ->> K : cab.booking.events\nBookingCanceled
      BS --> GW : 200 OK {booking}
      deactivate BS
      GW --> C : 200 OK {booking}
      deactivate GW
      break Booking da huy; dung dispatch
    else Khong co tai xe chap nhan truoc khi offer het han
      ... Offer Redis het han sau 15 giay ...
      BS -> R : Dispatcher kiem tra offer expiry\n(chay dinh ky moi 3 giay)
      R --> BS : Offer het han
      BS -> BDB : Lay candidate tiep theo
      BDB --> BS : Tai xe tiep theo hoac het danh sach
      alt Con tai xe tiep theo
        BS -> BDB : Cap nhat offered_driver_uid, offered_index
        BS -> R : Tao offer TTL moi 15 giay
        BS ->> K : cab.booking.events\nDriverOfferCreated cho tai xe tiep theo
      else Het danh sach tai xe
        BS -> BDB : UPDATE status = NO_DRIVERS_AVAILABLE\nxoa offered_driver_uid
        BDB --> BS : Booking khong tim thay tai xe
      end
    end
  end
end

== Tai xe thuc hien chuyen ==

note over C,TS
Trip bat dau tai DRIVER_ASSIGNED.
Moi lan cap nhat trang thai deu di qua Gateway va Trip Service.
Tai xe phai cap nhat dung thu tu; khong duoc nhay coc trang thai.
end note

loop Tien trinh chuyen di
  D -> GW : PATCH /api/v1/trips/{trip_id}/status\nIN_PROGRESS / COMPLETED
  activate GW
  GW -> GW : Kiem JWT va role = DRIVER
  GW -> TS : gRPC Invoke(update_status)\ntrip_id, driver_id tu JWT, status
  activate TS
  TS -> TDB : Doc trip va trang thai hien tai
  TDB --> TS : Trip
  TS -> TS : Kiem tai xe duoc gan\nva state transition hop le
  TS -> TDB : UPDATE trang thai trip
  TDB --> TS : Trang thai moi
  alt Chua COMPLETED
    TS ->> K : cab.trip.events\nTripStatusUpdated
  else Chuyen COMPLETED
    TS -> DS : gRPC Invoke(set_busy=false)
    activate DS
    DS -> DDB : BUSY -> AVAILABLE
    DS -> R : Dua tai xe tro lai Redis Geo
    DS --> TS : Tai xe san sang nhan chuyen
    deactivate DS
    TS ->> K : cab.trip.events\nTripCompleted
  end
  TS --> GW : 200 OK {trip, status, fare_amount}
  deactivate TS
  GW --> D : 200 OK
  deactivate GW
end

K ->> NS : Consume TripStatusUpdated / TripCompleted
activate NS
NS -> NDB : Ghi notification event log
NDB --> NS : Da ghi log
deactivate NS

== Thanh toan online (tuy chon sau khi chuyen hoan tat) ==

opt Khach hang chon thanh toan online
  C -> GW : POST /api/v1/payments/online\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT\nIdempotency-Key: UUID\n{trip_id}
  activate GW
  GW -> GW : Kiem JWT va role = CUSTOMER
  GW -> PS : gRPC Invoke(online)\ncustomer_id tu JWT + idempotency_key
  activate PS
  PS -> TS : gRPC Invoke(get trip)
  TS -> TDB : Doc trip
  TDB --> TS : customer_id, status, fare_amount
  TS --> PS : Chi chap nhan trip COMPLETED\nva dung customer
  PS -> PDB : INSERT Payment PENDING va response snapshot\ntrong transaction; unique Idempotency-Key
  PDB --> PS : Payment hoac response da luu
  PS --> GW : 200 OK {payment, PENDING}
  deactivate PS
  GW --> C : 200 OK {payment}
  deactivate GW

  opt Gui lai cung Idempotency-Key va cung trip
    C -> GW : Gui lai request thanh toan y het
    GW -> PS : gRPC Invoke(online)
    PS -> PDB : Doc response snapshot theo Idempotency-Key
    PDB --> PS : Response goc; khong tao payment moi
    PS --> GW : Tra lai response goc
    GW --> C : 200 OK; khong double charge
  end
end

note over PS,PDB #FEF3C7
Payment Service hien tao PENDING va co local signed-webhook endpoint.
Chua ket noi payment provider that; so tien lay tu trip, khong lay tu client.
end note

note over C,NS #FEE2E2
Gioi han hien tai:
- Notification Service tieu thu Kafka va ghi log, chua gui push/SMS.
- Backend chua co kenh realtime de gui trip_id/DriverAssigned ve Customer App.
- Khach hang nhan 201 ngay sau khi tao booking; viec tai xe chap nhan la request rieng.
end note

@enduml
